{"name": "Alchemortis", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/3be59f82a6458e8a6068e30e53275632.avif?t=1787749752\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/1ea4e7365720e25ee5173a7232b659e0.poster.avif?t=1787749752\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/1ea4e7365720e25ee5173a7232b659e0.webm?t=1787749752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/1ea4e7365720e25ee5173a7232b659e0.mp4?t=1787749752\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>Every item in the game can be thrown into the pot.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transmute and combine items in any configuration you like to merge their stats, properties, and forms \u2014 creating the perfect items. Take calculated risks, or embrace chaos and hope for the best. The possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/7bae074861dc25bcbc85dcebfdda4a6c.avif?t=1787749752\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/4b85c228714fef6d3ffab34ce77333a1.poster.avif?t=1787749752\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/4b85c228714fef6d3ffab34ce77333a1.webm?t=1787749752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/4b85c228714fef6d3ffab34ce77333a1.mp4?t=1787749752\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong><u>Your inventory is your build.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e\u200eArrange items in your inventory to unlock powerful effects, maximize synergies, and create devastating combos! <br/>\u200eWith limited space and items of all shapes and sizes, positioning is everything.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/2c5b3cf28a2f6cc9c4c41bfc18ee159d.avif?t=1787749752\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/e8b87d6ec1cb98e85b962712bfedef5f.poster.avif?t=1787749752\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/e8b87d6ec1cb98e85b962712bfedef5f.webm?t=1787749752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/e8b87d6ec1cb98e85b962712bfedef5f.mp4?t=1787749752\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Once the encounter begins, all you can do is watch.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let your strategic genius speak for itself. Is your build optimized? Are all synergies properly set up? Is positioning correct? There\u2019s only one way to find out. With every turn, the battle moves closer to its resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/b5371e765f552d63d6e37889b33a1cb8.avif?t=1787749752\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/88553722f1400817f19cac3f41b97bf3.poster.avif?t=1787749752\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/88553722f1400817f19cac3f41b97bf3.webm?t=1787749752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/88553722f1400817f19cac3f41b97bf3.mp4?t=1787749752\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong><u>No two runs are the same.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your path. Decide what matters most. A new item? An upgrade? A rare artifact? You can\u2019t have it all.<br/>Struggle toward the end \u2014 and when you inevitably fail, begin again from nothing. Such is the fate of an alchemist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/8035a8d808a6ddba9eae982322b8b067.avif?t=1787749752\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/df3e3af56da77ac572eb2614679009cc.poster.avif?t=1787749752\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/df3e3af56da77ac572eb2614679009cc.webm?t=1787749752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/df3e3af56da77ac572eb2614679009cc.mp4?t=1787749752\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Once you unlock something, it stays with you forever.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover characters, items, and artifacts through sheer luck or by conquering challenges. New characters unlock entirely new playstyles, while items and artifacts expand possibilities and enhance synergies. Discover every secret of <i>Alchemortis</i>!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Alchemortis is a roguelike inventory-management auto-battler about alchemy. Transmute and combine items to merge their stats, properties, and forms, then organize your inventory to unlock powerful synergies. Experiment, optimize, and craft the perfect build through the power of alchemy.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/c2b389f3e0602b4319262477b0018677519f6c36/header.jpg?t=1787749752", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Auto Battler", "Inventory Management", "Roguelite", "Strategy", "Indie", "2D"], "developers": "Firebelley", "publishers": "Firebelley", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3967230", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "6 February 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/JWXg7OwEO0U", "first_seen": 1770336000.0, "review_rank": 1247}